# Implementation Plan: Dual-Sensor Synchronization, Server Diagnostics & In-Room Presence Enhancements

Address all approved problem statements: add live server connectivity diagnostics, enable optimistic presenter room hosting, update the subtitle to **"Zero-Hardware Dual-Sensor Presence Engine (BLE + Wi-Fi)"**, harden BLE token resolution, and display real-time dual-sensor confidence and Wi-Fi match metrics in the UI.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Key Enhancements**:
> 1. **Live Server Health Indicator**: Real-time badge (`🟢 Connected (3s sync)` / `🔴 Server Unreachable`) and explicit network error banner so you immediately know if the backend IP needs updating.
> 2. **Immediate Presenter Hosting**: Presenter device immediately renders itself as active Host in the in-room table without waiting for server network round-trips.
> 3. **Dual-Sensor Table Display**: Confirmed participants display live confidence scores (e.g., `98% Confirmed`) and Wi-Fi similarity badges (e.g., `📶 100% Wi-Fi Match`).
> 4. **Token Resolution Hardening**: Synchronize BLE advertisement payload to full 16 bytes across Kotlin native code and TypeScript to ensure 100% peer graph edge resolution.
> 5. **Fresh APK Build**: Automatic re-bundling of `index.android.bundle` and Gradle compilation into `outputs/ConfPresence-ZERO.apk`.

